{
    "nodes": [
        {
            "id": "65e0f469-e3d8-4f58-a31a-3ef086e238b4",
            "index": 0,
            "characterId": "ec21035f-a4fe-4bb6-b877-eb871a5ec2cf",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3021",
            "content": {
                "en": "Well, well—little girl. We meet again.",
                "zh": "哟，小姑娘，又见面啦？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 100.0,
            "positionY": 100.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "248bb98e-0078-46ae-b72d-c4f0214b2acd",
            "index": 1,
            "characterId": "d5be2dcf-87aa-4ebc-afce-674209069707",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3022",
            "content": {
                "en": "Um… earlier, inside the apartment building, I ran into something strange.",
                "zh": "那个......我之前在公寓楼里，遇见了奇怪的东西。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 442.6666564941406,
            "positionY": 100.66667175292969,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "0b03d5c1-5f14-4993-9f03-b67aea57b3ba",
            "index": 2,
            "characterId": "3d251560-306a-4584-8903-bebe74011bfc",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3023",
            "content": {
                "en": "Do you know what that was?",
                "zh": "您知道是怎么回事吗？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 790.0,
            "positionY": 105.33332824707031,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "81a6061b-f8cb-4afe-a950-c28529830d71",
            "index": 3,
            "characterId": "ec21035f-a4fe-4bb6-b877-eb871a5ec2cf",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3024",
            "content": {
                "en": "......",
                "zh": "......",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1138.6666259765625,
            "positionY": 112.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "27a690b0-c8d7-48a0-a6ba-8f1c5176abab",
            "index": 4,
            "characterId": "ec21035f-a4fe-4bb6-b877-eb871a5ec2cf",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3025",
            "content": {
                "en": "I knew it… no wonder you stayed in there so long… (muttering)",
                "zh": "我就说......怎么在里头待了那么久......（嘟囔）",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1486.6666259765625,
            "positionY": 118.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "3bc563f4-2f04-497a-bdac-a177d0772604",
            "index": 5,
            "characterId": "ec21035f-a4fe-4bb6-b877-eb871a5ec2cf",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3026",
            "content": {
                "en": "Things haven’t been peaceful in Yuntai lately. Weird folks keep showing up and causing trouble. I’m just glad you’re alright.",
                "zh": "最近芸台市里不太平呀，总有奇怪的家伙到处闹事。你没事就好。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1836.6666259765625,
            "positionY": 120.66667175292969,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "ff0137fe-ee5d-41f6-a1ad-7e48a1a28e1c",
            "index": 6,
            "characterId": "9bf1f67d-ba62-4b57-a9cc-3ce252972f0f",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3027",
            "content": {
                "en": "Yeah. Sir, do you know anything about the Elysium Troupe?",
                "zh": "嗯。大爷你知道极乐戏团的事吗？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2180.666748046875,
            "positionY": 123.33332824707031,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "6667a91a-c69b-4457-91dd-9a25bc798162",
            "index": 7,
            "characterId": "ec21035f-a4fe-4bb6-b877-eb871a5ec2cf",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3028",
            "content": {
                "en": "Not really. This old man doesn’t care for opera.",
                "zh": "不太清楚，老头子我不爱听戏。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2526.0,
            "positionY": 129.3333282470703,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "b23be4f2-8ffa-4456-8a08-8f9355d7fde9",
            "index": 8,
            "characterId": "ec21035f-a4fe-4bb6-b877-eb871a5ec2cf",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3029",
            "content": {
                "en": "But come to think of it, there should be a stage up ahead.",
                "zh": "说起来，前面好像有个戏台来着。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2879.33349609375,
            "positionY": 136.6666717529297,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "bc1163a4-f22b-42e4-89d1-04f204ad5672",
            "index": 10,
            "characterId": "ec21035f-a4fe-4bb6-b877-eb871a5ec2cf",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3031",
            "content": {
                "en": "Oh! You’re going to find Little Shen—aren’t you?",
                "zh": "噢！你要去找小沈对吧？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 3571.33349609375,
            "positionY": 143.3333282470703,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "c4d52f27-202d-43d7-9d98-8bcdbb2c7811",
            "index": 9,
            "characterId": "443ed651-99c1-456e-8295-e76ba2741aa7",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3030",
            "content": {
                "en": "Right. I’m going to the stage to find my friend.",
                "zh": "对的，我要去戏台那边找我的朋友。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 3223.33349609375,
            "positionY": 139.3333282470703,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "67e7a707-5306-41ae-982c-d4718404695b",
            "index": 11,
            "characterId": "ec21035f-a4fe-4bb6-b877-eb871a5ec2cf",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3032",
            "content": {
                "en": "Mm… then you’d better be careful. That kid… she’s got a lot on her mind, and a heavy burden on her shoulders.",
                "zh": "嗯......那可得小心些了。小沈这孩子，心思深，身上的担子也重。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 3912.0,
            "positionY": 148.6666717529297,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "b41b921a-c246-4cee-9eae-94ee9ae083fe",
            "index": 12,
            "characterId": "ec21035f-a4fe-4bb6-b877-eb871a5ec2cf",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3033",
            "content": {
                "en": "Plenty of eyes are on her. Sigh… don’t get yourself dragged into it…",
                "zh": "盯着她的眼睛可真不少啊。唉......别被卷进去了......",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 4257.3330078125,
            "positionY": 152.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "e3707f17-c8f2-4bfe-8138-930555e15b29",
            "index": 13,
            "characterId": "3d251560-306a-4584-8903-bebe74011bfc",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3034",
            "content": {
                "en": "What do you mean by that? Is Noema being watched? Will she be in danger?",
                "zh": "您这话是什么意思？梦之她被人盯上了？她会有危险吗？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 4604.66650390625,
            "positionY": 156.6666717529297,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "693849c2-d46e-426f-bc5f-5c7dc30dda82",
            "index": 14,
            "characterId": "ec21035f-a4fe-4bb6-b877-eb871a5ec2cf",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3035",
            "content": {
                "en": "......",
                "zh": "......",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 4950.66650390625,
            "positionY": 159.3333282470703,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
